Subject: [PATCH] kernel/arm64: identity as K-One-Kernel

T nominally kernel jadi K-One-Kernel:
  - NAME di Makefile          -> banner boot / uname -a (aman)
  - CONFIG_LOCALVERSION       -> uname -r (berbahaya)

CONFIG_LOCALVERSION ikut ter-embed ke vermagic setiap modul, jadi suffix
WAJIB sama persis dengan output 'adb shell uname -r' di perangkat. Jika
berbeda, modul vendor akan gagal dimuat.

Hasil yang diharapkan:
  uname -r = 6.6.89-android15-8-maybe-dirty-K-One-Kernel

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 PATCHLEVEL = 6
 SUBLEVEL = 89
 EXTRAVERSION =
-NAME = Pinguïn Aangedreven
+NAME = K-One-Kernel
 
 # *DOCUMENTATION*
 # To see a list of typical targets execute "make help"
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 CONFIG_INIT_ENV_ARG_LIMIT=32
 # CONFIG_COMPILE_TEST is not set
 CONFIG_WERROR=y
-CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-rethinking"
+CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-K-One-Kernel"
 CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO=y
 CONFIG_BUILD_SALT=""
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_INIT=""
